Package: @PKG@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cp0-ir-remote maintainers <cp0-ir-remote@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pil, python3-numpy, fonts-noto-cjk, v4l-utils, openssl, luajit
Description: Native IR universal remote for CardputerZero
 A framebuffer-native infrared remote for the M5Stack CardputerZero.
 It draws straight to /dev/fb0 and reads the on-board TCA8418 keyboard,
 uses the Xiaomi Mi Home IR code database (AES encrypted patterns) and
 emits raw waveforms through /dev/lirc0.
 .
 No browser, no web server: launched from APPLaunch like any other
 native app. Codes are cached on disk so a working remote keeps
 working offline.
